---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { BUG_REPORT_URL } from '../consts';

// The app's About pane links here, so keep the URL. Reports go to the bug report issue form in this
// site's public repo (.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/bug_report.yml), which asks for the same details as below.
const details = [
  { label: 'Typer Util version', where: 'Preferences → About' },
  { label: 'macOS version', where: 'Apple menu → About This Mac' },
  { label: 'The app you were typing into', where: 'and the website, if it was a browser' },
  { label: 'Your keyboard layout', where: 'System Settings → Keyboard → Text Input' },
];
---

<Layout title="Report a bug" description="Tell us about something in Typer Util that isn’t working right.">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-24">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-balance text-zinc-900 dark:text-white">Report a bug</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-pretty text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">
      Something not typing right? Tell us what happened and we’ll look into it.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200 bg-zinc-50 p-6 dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-900/60">
      <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-white">Have these handy</h2>
      <dl class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm">
        {details.map((detail) => (
          <div>
            <dt class="font-medium text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200">{detail.label}</dt>
            <dd class="text-zinc-500">{detail.where}</dd>
          </div>
        ))}
      </dl>
      <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">
        The keyboard layout matters because Typer Util types each character through it. If the wrong characters
        appeared, it’s often the reason.
      </p>
    </div>

    <a href={BUG_REPORT_URL} class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-brand-500 px-5 py-3 font-medium text-white shadow-lg shadow-brand-500/25 hover:bg-brand-600">
      Open the bug report form
      <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
    </a>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-zinc-500">
      Reports are filed as public issues on GitHub, which needs a free account. Please don’t include anything
      sensitive, like passwords you were typing.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
